(7508957, 1197766, 25024, '<td valign="top">Hello from the critique club<br/> <br/>An appealing image that contributes to the challenge		<br/> <br/>This is a great idea Yao. I really like the way you have combined these together, its an interesting and original concept that works well. What I feel would improve it is for the wood shavings to also be sharp. You have a plain black background so against that having everything nice and sharp would definitely improve its impact.</td>', 'Hello from the critique club An appealing image that contributes to the challenge		 This is a great idea Yao. I really like the way you have combined these together, its an interesting and original concept that works well. What I feel would improve it is for the wood shavings to also be sharp. You have a plain black background so against that having everything nice and sharp would definitely improve its impact.', '2017-04-12 09:33:04.000000', NULL, 0),
